<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Here every welcome guest</l><l>Waits, Lord, from Thee to learn</l><l>The secrets of Thy Father’s breast,</l><l>And all Thy grace discern.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Here conscience ends its strife,</l><l>And faith delights to prove</l><l>The sweetness of the Bread of Life,</l><l>The fulness of Thy love.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>That blood that flowed for sin</l><l>In symbol here we see,</l><l>And feel the blessed pledge within</l><l>That we are loved of Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>O if this glimpse of love</l><l>Is so divinely sweet,</l><l>What will it be, O Lord, above,</l><l>Thy gladd’ning smile to meet!</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>To see Thee face to face,</l><l>Thy perfect likeness wear,</l><l>And all Thy ways of wondrous grace</l><l>Through endless years declare.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
